  "description": "The Rambo Revolt AWD is a compact, full-suspension electric bike built for riders who demand maximum traction, torque, and reliability in a lightweight package. Powered by dual 500W hub motors delivering a combined 1000W of all-wheel-drive performance, the Revolt is engineered to tackle rugged trails, steep terrain, mud, sand, and backcountry adventures with confidence. Its agile 20-inch wheel platform provides exceptional maneuverability while maintaining the power needed for hunting, camping, ranch work, and outdoor exploration. A maintenance-free single-speed drivetrain keeps operation simple and dependable, while the EXSHO front suspension fork and dual EXA rear shocks deliver a smooth, comfortable ride across rough terrain. Designed with comfort and control in mind, the Revolt AWD features raised handlebars, aggressive all-terrain tires, and a full-suspension frame that inspires confidence on every ride. A powerful LED headlight and optional rear taillight enhance visibility during early morning starts and after-dark returns. Whether you're navigating tight trails, accessing remote hunting locations, or exploring the outdoors, the Rambo Revolt AWD combines all-wheel-drive capability, full suspension, and compact handling into one of the most versatile electric bikes in its class",
